<title>USA: Piedmont Bancorp Inc Q3 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Piedmont Bancorp Inc Q3 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>HILLSBOROUGH, N.C. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss)		    $   372,000   $   503,000</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per share		     0.14	    0.20</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding  2,670,386     2,436,612</p>
<p>					    Nine Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>							1997	    1996</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss)			(876,000)     1,214,000</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per share		   (0.33)	    0.25</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding  2,627,126     2,446,891</p>
<p>Excluding non-recurring items</p>
<p>Net earnings excluding non-recurring</p>
<p>  items					 1,187,000</p>
<p>Earnings per share excluding non-</p>
<p>  recurring items				  0.46</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said its decreased earnings for its current nine-month period were due to a drop in net interest income resulting from the sale of investments in December 1996 to payoff a special dividend.</p>
<p>The company also said weighted average shares outstanding for last year's periods include only net income and shares outstanding before its mutual-to-stock conversion on December 7, 1995.</p>
</text>
